ts/_next/static/immutable/chunks/1p31g3z3kho5v.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2qeyp4zfa4qwb.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/3sj_xp-v1_jxx.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2njnkxjf39nsf.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0ph1ht6wvel_v.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/2zfre20tirh12.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/05i2jce8amocn.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/0v-er0xp5q011.js\",\"/creators-assets/_next/static/immutable/chunks/05hazywx-xcuh.js\"],\"UnifiedExploreGrid\"]\n4d:T57e,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e My 61st template is on \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca class=\"mention\" data-type=\"mention\" data-id=\"a7cd9fe6-cf81-4a41-8e93-bca0291dba80\" href=\"/community/creator/@framer/\"\u003e@Framer\u003c/a\u003e , \u003ca href=\"https://framer.link/ncy7mz4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOrbital \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ejust went live for free - \u003c/strong\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://framer.link/ncy7mz4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003etake a free remix \u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe old marketplace ran on browsing. You scrolled, you clicked, you compared.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe new one runs on search and matching. Tags, titles, and descriptions carry more weight than they used to.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHere\u0026#39;s what most listings still get wrong:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ One tag on a listing that could realistically match five categories\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Titles missing the word \u0026quot;Template,\u0026quot; so search skips them\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Descriptions written for a person, not for how the system reads them\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e→ Keywords pasted into the body instead of placed in the tag fields\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNone of this is cosmetic. It\u0026#39;s the difference between showing up in a search and not existing at all.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBefore publishing Orbital, I went back through my own tags first because a good template that can\u0026#39;t be found doesn\u0026#39;t matter.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf you\u0026#39;ve got listings live right now, check your tags today. It\u0026#39;s the fastest fix on the platform.\u003c/p\u003e4e:T869,\u003cp\u003eKorvex — Branding \u0026amp; Creative Agency Framer Template\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKorvex is a premium Framer template crafted for branding agencies, creative studios, design teams, and independent creatives who want to showcase their work with confidence, clarity, and a modern visual presence. \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMore than just a website template, Korvex is a complete platform for showcasing brand identity projects, creative campaigns, web design work, digital experiences, and agency capabilities.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePerfect For\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBranding Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesign Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMarketing \u0026amp; Advertising Teams\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eUI/UX Design Studios\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFramer Designers \u0026amp; Developers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Freelancers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDigital Product Agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eStartup Branding Teams\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreative Consultants\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhy Choose Korvex?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eKorvex is built to help agencies communicate their value clearly and professionally. The layout balances aesthetics with usability, ensuring that visitors can easily explore your services, portfolio, case studies, team, and contact information without distractions.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIts flexible structure allows you to customize content, colors, typography, imagery, and sections effortlessly, making it suitable for a wide variety of creative businesses. From showcasing brand transformations and visual identity systems to presenting website projects and creative campaigns, Korvex adapts to your workflow and growth.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFeatures \u0026amp; Benefits\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eModern and premium visual design\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive across all devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFast-loading and optimized for performance\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy customization with Framer\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth animations and interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eProfessional portfolio and project showcase\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eService-focused conversion sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTeam, process, and agency storytelling layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-friendly structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eScalable design system for future growth\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClean user experience that highlights your work\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e4f:T7e8,\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFitlex — Fitness \u0026amp; Gym Studio Framer Template\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFitlex is a bold, modern Framer template built for gyms, fitness studios, personal trainers, and coaching brands that want a high-energy online presence. With a clean layout, strong typography, and smooth scroll animations, it\u0026#39;s designed to convert visitors into members.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages included:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHome\u003c/strong\u003e — Hero section, member stats, training highlights, \u0026quot;why choose us,\u0026quot; pricing plans, testimonials, transformation showcase, FAQ, and a call-to-action section\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAbout\u003c/strong\u003e — Studio story and brand messaging\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBlogs\u003c/strong\u003e — A fully connected CMS collection for workout tips, nutrition guides, and training articles\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact\u003c/strong\u003e — Contact form and studio info (address, phone, email, map)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e404\u003c/strong\u003e — Custom error page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey features:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully responsive design for desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered blog section — add, edit, or remove posts with no code\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt-in pricing table with multiple membership tiers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eClient transformation/results slider\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonials and social proof sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSocial media integration\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEasy to customize colors, fonts, and content — no coding required\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuilt 100% in Framer, ready to publish instantly\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for gyms, personal trainers, fitness coaches, wellness studios, and health \u0026amp; wellness brands looking for a fast, professional launch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"link\"\u003e🔗\u003c/span\u003e Live preview: \u003ca href=\"http://fitlex.framer.website\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003efitlex.framer.website\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWant this template to be customized for your business then kindly reach out to this email belakyrecody@gmail.com for customization work\u003c/p\u003e50:T4c4,\u003cp\u003eOrbital is a modern Framer template for AI startups, SaaS companies, AI agent platforms, developer tools, and next-generation technology products.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned with a bold, futuristic visual style, Orbital helps you present complex AI products clearly, engagingly, and professionally. Showcase your product, AI agents, features, integrations, use cases, pricing, and technical capabilities with conversion-focused layouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrbital is ideal for AI SaaS, agentic AI platforms, automation tools, machine learning products, developer platforms, B2B SaaS, and technology startups.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFeatures\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Modern AI SaaS landing page \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• AI agent-focused layouts \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Product and feature sections \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Use case showcases \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Integrations section \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Pricing layouts \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Blog and CMS-ready structure \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Responsive design \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Smooth animations and interactions \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Reusable components \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Easy customization \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• SEO-friendly structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhether you\u0026#39;re launching an AI startup, building an AI agent platform, or creating a developer-focused SaaS product, Orbital gives you a polished foundation to launch faster.\u003c/p\u003e51:T9fc,\u003cp\u003eA garage website has one job before anything else: tell someone what you fix, whether you can look at their car this week, and what happens next. CARFIX TNC is a cars website template for Framer organized around that, with the services and contact routes doing the work rather than the hero image.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eAt a glance\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePages:\u003c/strong\u003e 14 total (8 static, 4 CMS collections, 1 folder)\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCMS collections:\u003c/strong\u003e blog, category, product and service\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eOnline store:\u003c/strong\u003e product, cart and checkout pages included as designs. Framer has no native store, so payment runs through a checkout you connect\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eContact form:\u003c/strong\u003e yes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eResponsive:\u003c/strong\u003e desktop, tablet and phone\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBuilt with:\u003c/strong\u003e Framer, no code\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePages included\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome, About Us, Blog, Checkout, Contact Us, FAQ, Products and Services, plus template pages for blog, category, product and service, and 404.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWhat it does not do\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt presents your garage and takes inquiries. It does not run a booking diary with technician availability, produce estimates or invoices, look up vehicles by registration, or track jobs through the workshop.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWho it is for\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eCARFIX TNC works best as a cars website template for:\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eIndependent garages and servicing centers taking bookings by inquiry\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTyre, exhaust and diagnostic specialists with a defined service list\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eWorkshops that also sell parts or accessories over the counter\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFAQ\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCan customers book a slot online?\u003c/strong\u003e Not natively. The site takes a booking inquiry and you confirm.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCan I sell parts through the site?\u003c/strong\u003e Yes. Products and checkout are included, so accessories, consumables and parts can be sold directly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHow do I add a new service?\u003c/strong\u003e Add an entry to the services collection. It gets its own page and appears in the services listing automatically.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eCustomizing it\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eWe can customize this cars website template for you, from color and content through to new pages. \u003ca href=\"https://tncflow.com/request-a-quote/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRequest a quote\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e or see our \u003ca href=\"https://tncflow.com/framer-website-development-customization-service/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFramer customization service\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e. Support and updates are included.\u003c/p\u003e52:Tb19,\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://zeeny.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"arrow_upper_right\"\u003e↗\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e Live preview\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003ca href=\"https://www.workshop99.agency/templates-landing\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cspan data-type=\"emoji\" data-name=\"arrow_upper_right\"\u003e↗\u003c/span\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e More Framer templates\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eZeen · Personal Brand Accelerator Template\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eZeen is a premium, long-form landing page Framer template built for coaches, consultants, founders, and course creators selling a cohort program, accelerator, or high-ticket offer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstead of a scattered multi-page site, Zeen is engineered as one persuasive scroll: a high-contrast hero, problem agitation, a phased framework, curriculum modules, a practitioner/tutor lineup, tiered pricing, an application form, and an objection-handling FAQ — all sequenced to move an expert visitor from \u0026quot;undiscovered\u0026quot; to \u0026quot;applied.\u0026quot; Every section is written to sell a program, not just describe one.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIt works just as well for masterminds, workshops, paid communities, and productized coaching — anywhere you need one focused page to fill a cohort.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch your accelerator page this week and start taking applications.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eThis template is for you if you want to\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSell a cohort, course, or accelerator with a page structured around problem, framework, and proof\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFill applications with a focused contact form and repeated, high-intent CTAs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePresent your curriculum clearly with modules and a phased, chronological framework layout\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBuild authority with a practitioner/tutor section that positions you as an operator, not a theorist\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eConvert with tiered pricing and an FAQ that answers logistics before they cost you the sale\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate urgency with a countdown to your next cohort\u0026#39;s registration deadline\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWhat you get:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eComplete single-page accelerator/course sales layout with anchor-linked navigation\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eModular sections: hero, problem, framework, curriculum, tutors, pricing, application form, FAQ, final CTA\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTiered pricing section with tabbed plan options\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eApplication/contact form ready to connect to your own tool\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCountdown timer, ready to set to your cohort deadline\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eEditorial, high-contrast visual system designed to be re-skinned for any brand\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCONTACT\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuestions? Reach out via \u003ca href=\"http://x.com\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ex.com\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e or email \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@workshop99.agency\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ehello@workshop99.agency\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e53:T41d,\u003cp\u003eTRBN One is a cinematic one-page portfolio template for designers, developers, and independent creatives who want their work to feel like a world, not another grid.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBased on a personal portfolio that reached #26 in the Framer Gallery, TRBN One combines atmospheric visuals, editorial typography, and purposeful motion with a clear structure that guides visitors from introduction to contact.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhat’s included\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Responsive desktop, tablet, and mobile layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Image- and video-ready cinematic hero\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• About, services, selected work, process, pricing, and contact sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Smooth scrolling and interactive details\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Easily editable typography, colors, media, text, and links\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• No coding required\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect for\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• UI/UX and web designers\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Framer developers\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Art directors and digital artists\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e• Freelancers and independent creatives\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReplace the demonstration content with your own work, connect your domain, and publish directly through Framer.\u003c/p\u003e54:T7c9,\u003ch2\u003eAbout Outline Studio\u003c/h2\u003e\u003ch3\u003eMake a lasting impression.\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eOutline Studio is a complete website template for agencies and creative studios, built to showcase your work, explain your services, and turn visitors into clients.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDetailed project case studies are powered by a dedicated CMS collection, making it easy to add new work while keeping every project consistent. Services, process, testimonials, awards, and pricing give potential clients everything they need to understand your studio and build trust.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA ready-to-publish Coming Soon page lets you start collecting email sign-ups while you prepare the full site for launch. Legal pages are also included and can be quickly customized with your business details.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOutline Studio gives creative agencies and independent studios everything they need to structure their content, showcase their work, and launch a complete website without starting from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eFeatures\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e30+ sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFully modular, component-based system\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eLight \u0026amp; dark themes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCase Studies CMS collection\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eList \u0026amp; grid project views\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCustom animations \u0026amp; interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive on all devices\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-ready \u0026amp; performance-optimized\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eBonus:\u003c/strong\u003e Customizable 3D Logo, upload your own\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003ePages\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHome\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eStudio:\u003c/strong\u003e Work, Case Studies (CMS), Contact\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLegal:\u003c/strong\u003e Privacy, Terms\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eLaunch:\u003c/strong\u003e Coming Soon\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUtility:\u003c/strong\u003e 404\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eLearn More\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eNew to Framer? Learn how it works at \u003ca href=\"https://www.framer.com/academy/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003eFramer Academy\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eSupport\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor template questions and support, contact \u003ca href=\"mailto:support@staticmotion.io\"\u003esupport@staticmotion.io\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e55:T7fc,\u003cp\u003eAoutive is a Framer template for AI workflow automation platforms, integration tools, and operations SaaS startups. Build a complete product website for a visual workflow builder, an AI decision engine, or a business process automation tool.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe template uses a modern product aesthetic with a four-part engine section, an infrastructure feature block, five use case cards, stat counters, an integrations section, three-tier pricing, a six-question FAQ, and a CMS articles blog.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhat is Included\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHome, About, Articles, Contact, and legal pages. The homepage includes a hero with a product screenshot, a logo bar, an AI engine section, an infrastructure block, use case cards, stat counters, integrations, pricing, FAQ, and a closing CTA. CMS collections cover Articles and Legal pages, both with detail pages manageable without code.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKey Features\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe AI engine section covers workflow automation, integrations for CRMs and APIs, data processing, and a decision engine that triggers next actions. The infrastructure block covers high availability with multi-region failover, low-latency execution, edge delivery, a scalable workflow engine, and fault tolerance. Five use case cards cover lead qualification, ticket routing, campaign automation, data sync, and invoice processing. Three pricing tiers cover workflow limits, integrations, monitoring, and enterprise security with SSO.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWho This Is For\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSuited to workflow automation founders, integration platform teams, operations SaaS startups, AI decision engine products, and business process tools targeting sales, support, and operations teams.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTemplate Details\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePlatform Framer, CMS articles and legal collections, engine section, infrastructure block, five use cases, integrations grid, three pricing tiers, six FAQ questions, newsletter signup, fully responsive, no code required, one purchase for unlimited sites.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAoutive gives workflow automation products a clear website with structured use cases and transparent pricing.\u003c/p\u003e56:T6ab,\u003cp\u003eMenu Maison — Restaurant Menu \u0026amp; Reservation Framer Template\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMenu Maison is a menu-focused Framer template for restaurants, cafés, bars, and modern food brands. A CMS-powered food and drinks menu lets visitors filter categories and browse pricing without leaving the page, while a dedicated reservation form collects guest details, date and time, party size, and special requests — all editable from Framer CMS, with no coding required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLive Preview: \u003ca href=\"https://maisonmenu.framer.website/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" target=\"_blank\"\u003ehttps://maisonmenu.framer.website/\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeatures\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-powered food and drinks menu\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInteractive category filtering\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDedicated table reservation form with date, time, and party size fields\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDish photography and clear pricing\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFeatured and favourite dishes\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSticky mobile category filters\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive menu grids across desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReusable menu cards and components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eOrganized layers and CMS collections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003ePerfect For\u003c/p\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eRestaurants and bistros\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCafés and bakeries\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePizzerias\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCocktail bars\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFood trucks\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCatering businesses\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrivate chefs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSeasonal dining concepts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003cp\u003eTags\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRestaurant Menu, Menu Reservation, Table Booking, Digital Menu, Food Menu, Drinks Menu, Café, Bar, Framer CMS, Menu Filtering, Dining, Hospitality, Responsive\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSupport\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eQuestions or need a hand? Reach out at \u003ca href=\"mailto:hello@soleno.io\"\u003ehello@soleno.io\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e57:T8e1,\u003cp\u003eDentelio — Modern Dental Framer Template\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDentelio is a modern, premium Framer template crafted for dental clinics, dentists, orthodontists, cosmetic dentistry, and healthcare brands. It combines a clean editorial layout with bold typography, smooth animations, micro-interactions, and conversion-focused sections to create a polished digital experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDesigned with a strong focus on modern UI and user experience, Dentelio uses spacious layouts, refined typography, subtle motion effects, interactive elements, and carefully structured sections to make every scroll feel engaging and professional.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e✦ What’s Included\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eModern Home page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAbout page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eServices page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDoctors page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eGallery page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eContact / Appointment page\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponsive desktop, tablet \u0026amp; mobile layouts\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSmooth animations \u0026amp; micro-interactions\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eInteractive hover effects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eModern scrolling effects\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eReusable components\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eCMS-ready content structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlog CMS\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDoctor \u0026amp; service sections\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eTestimonials\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFAQ section\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eAppointment-focused CTAs\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eSEO-friendly structure\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003e✦ Modern Homepage Experience\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe homepage features a bold hero, services, clinic statistics, interactive gallery, treatment process, specialist profiles, benefits, testimonials, FAQs, and strong appointment CTAs. Every section is balanced with whitespace, imagery, typography, and subtle motion for a clean and engaging experience.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e✦ CMS \u0026amp; Easy Customization\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDentelio is built with reusable and flexible content in mind. Easily update services, doctors, blog posts, images, testimonials, colors, typography, and branding directly in Framer.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003e✦ Built for Modern Dental Brands\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003eDentelio brings together modern layouts, smooth effects, micro-interactions, responsive design, CMS flexibility, and conversion-focused sections in one premium Framer template.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCreate a dental website that feels clean, modern, trustworthy, and memorable — without starting from scratch.\u003c/p\u003e58:T769,\u003cp\u003eLooking to create a professional website for your medical clinic or wellness practice? \u003cstrong\u003eMedispa – Premium Medical \u0026amp; Wellness Framer Template\u003c/strong\u003e is designed for medspas, healthcare professionals, doctors, dermatology clinics, and wellness centers seeking a trustworthy online presence.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith its clean, calming, and sophisticated design, Medispa helps you present your treatments, services, team, facilities, and expertise in a polished way. Every section is thoughtfully structured to create a comfortable experience for visitors while guiding them toward booking an appointment or contacting your clinic.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eWho Is It For?\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eMedspas and wellness clinics\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDoctors and healthcare professionals\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eDermatology and aesthetic clinics\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eHolistic health and wellness centers\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003cli\u003e\u003cp\u003eFreelance designers and agencies\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\u003c/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c/h3\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCalming Medical Design\u003c/strong\u003e Create a welcoming atmosphere with elegant layouts, refined typography, and spacious sections.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTreatment \u0026amp; Service Showcase\u003c/strong\u003e Present your treatments, technologies, products, and wellness solutions clearly.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProfessional Team Sections\u003c/strong\u003e Introduce your specialists and healthcare professionals to build credibility and trust.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFully Responsive\u003c/strong\u003e Provide a seamless experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Framer Customization\u003c/strong\u003e Update colors, fonts, images, content, and components without coding.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTrust-Focused Experience\u003c/strong\u003e Build confidence with testimonials, informative content, contact sections, and professional layouts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith Medispa, create a premium healthcare website that reflects medical excellence, builds patient confidence, and turns visitors into potential appointments.\u003c/p\u003e59:Tb66,\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDentora Lab: Dental Clinic \u0026amp; Healthcare \u0026amp; Dentist Website Framer Template\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003eDentora Lab is a conversion-focused dental clinic and healthcare website template built for modern dental practices, orthodontists, cosmetic dentists, and healthcare providers who want to establish trust and attract more patients online. Designed with clean layouts, strategic content sections, and a patient-first experience, Dentora Lab helps you launch a professional website in hours — no coding required.\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePERFECT FOR:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Dental Clinics \u0026amp; Family Dentistry Practices\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Cosmetic Dentistry \u0026amp; Smile Makeover Centers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Orthodontists \u0026amp; Braces Specialists\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Dental Implant \u0026amp; Restorative Clinics\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Pediatric Dental Clinics\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Emergency Dental Care Providers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Multi-Specialty Healthcare Centers\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eINCLUDED PAGES:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Home\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- About\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Service\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Doctors\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Blog\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Technology\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Pricing\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Gallery\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Patients Stories\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Full Story\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Emergency Care\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- FAQ\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Appointment\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- 404\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eEVERY PAGE IS DESIGNED FOR CONVERSION:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Clear and engaging visual hierarchy\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Strategic appointment booking CTAs\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Trust-building patient stories and testimonials\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Doctor and technology showcases\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Service-focused layouts that educate and convert\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Mobile-first experience across all devices\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eFrom the first visit to the final appointment booking, Dentora Lab is structured to guide patients through a seamless journey while building confidence in your clinic.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eWHY CHOOSE DENTORA LAB:\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Modern and professional healthcare design\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Fully responsive across desktop, tablet, and mobile\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- SEO-friendly structure for better visibility\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Easy to customize and rebrand\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Framer CMS integration\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Fast-loading and optimized performance\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- Built to increase appointments and patient inquiries\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003e- No coding required\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLaunch your dental clinic website today with Dentora Lab — a premium Framer template designed to help healthcare professionals grow their online presence and convert visitors into patients.\u003c/p\u003e30:[\"$\",\"$L4c\",null,{\"initialItems\":[{\"entityType\":\"post\",\"entityId\":\"01a047a4-0c61-725d-a202-ec0d8ab8bd7d\",\"entity\":{\"id\":\"01a047a4-0c61-725d-a202-ec0d8ab8bd7d\",\"title\":null,\"body\":\"$4d\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" My 61st template is on \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"mention\",\"attrs\":{\"id\":\"a7cd9fe6-cf81-4a41-8e93-bca0291dba80\",\"slug\":\"framer\",\"label\":\"Framer\",\"mentionSuggestionChar\":\"@\"}},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" , \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Orbital \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framer.link/ncy7mz4\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"just went live for free - \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"take a free remix \",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"href\":\"https://framer.link/ncy7mz4\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}},{\"type\":\"bold\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The old marketplace ran on browsing. You scrolled, you clicked, you compared.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The new one runs on search and matching. Tags, titles, and descriptions carry more weight than they used to.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Here's what most listings still get wrong:\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"→ One tag on a listing that could realistically match five categories\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"→ Titles missing the word \\\"Template,\\\" so search skips them\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"→ Descriptions written for a person, not for how the system reads them\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"→ Keywords pasted into the body instead of placed in the tag fields\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"None of this is cosmetic. It's the difference between showing up in a search and not existing at all.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Before publishing Orbital, I went back through my own tags first because a good template that can't be found doesn't matter.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If you've got listings live right now, check your tags today. It's the fastest fix on the platform.\"}]}]},\"author\":{\