tion with a real person.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"If you're building an AI platform or B2B SaaS product for enterprise clients, the page you leave out can convert better than the one you build.\"}]}]},\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"b2e693cc-f59c-4f8e-bde0-94300933232f\",\"name\":\"Gr8r Themes\",\"slug\":\"get-greater-quality-template-for-you-saas-ai-startup-business\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/29410/256px%20gr8r%20logo%20Orange-nLWk5qudXtDMsXR5C2wZI2mvFAiXwr.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"available\",\"pro\",\"expert\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/b2e693cc-f59c-4f8e-bde0-94300933232f/01a0466d-3aee-747a-94d0-283d4929d05d.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(0 0% 3%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.3333333333333333}}],\"resources\":[],\"contests\":[],\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"cf35162f-8406-49a9-a023-4c58024795ee\",\"name\":\"General\",\"slug\":\"general\",\"description\":\"General\",\"metaTitle\":\"General\",\"metaDescription\":\"General\"}],\"tags\":[],\"likes\":{\"count\":21,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":17},\"reposts\":{\"count\":8,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null},\"version\":1,\"edited\":false,\"editedAt\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-28T03:39:00.436Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-28T03:39:00.436Z\"}},{\"entityType\":\"post\",\"entityId\":\"01a042ec-5f1c-73c9-8d27-c5076d088d94\",\"entity\":{\"id\":\"01a042ec-5f1c-73c9-8d27-c5076d088d94\",\"title\":null,\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eSome of my past hero design work  \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWhich one is your favorite?  \u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOpen for work — feel free to DM me for design projects.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Some of my past hero design work  \"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\