p\u003eA new online store template is coming very soon!\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"A new online store template is coming very soon!\"}]}]},\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"18f5e39a-2d61-4a67-843a-3b4fc95a7f96\",\"name\":\"DariStudio\",\"slug\":\"daristudio\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/18f5e39a-2d61-4a67-843a-3b4fc95a7f96/mlxaui3u\",\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"image\",\"url\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/media/18f5e39a-2d61-4a67-843a-3b4fc95a7f96/01a047ce-758b-7292-8ac6-ef44b01e6c46.png\",\"metadata\":{\"tint\":\"hsl(30 29% 22%)\",\"aspectRatio\":1.6218293620292084}}],\"resources\":[],\"contests\":[],\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"cf35162f-8406-49a9-a023-4c58024795ee\",\"name\":\"General\",\"slug\":\"general\",\"description\":\"General\",\"metaTitle\":\"General\",\"metaDescription\":\"General\"}],\"tags\":[],\"likes\":{\"count\":8,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":3},\"reposts\":{\"count\":0,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null},\"version\":1,\"edited\":false,\"editedAt\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-28T09:58:35.570Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-28T09:58:35.570Z\"}},{\"entityType\":\"post\",\"entityId\":\"01a0323d-156b-75bf-9e0f-e1a4912c514f\",\"entity\":{\"id\":\"01a0323d-156b-75bf-9e0f-e1a4912c514f\",\"title\":null,\"body\":\"\u003cp\u003eFree to use for you , Just take it now - \u003ca href=\\\"https://framer.link/gwtnnxI\\\" rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"\u003ehttps://framer.link/gwtnnxI\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne line of copy, only when you hover.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNorell\u0026#39;s services section doesn\u0026#39;t explain everything upfront. It shows four names in bold, dim. You hover one, it lights up, the description appears next to it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe rest stays quiet on purpose.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNothing competes for attention until you ask for it.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat\u0026#39;s not simplicity. That\u0026#39;s control.\u003c/p\u003e\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Free to use for you , Just take it now - \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"https://framer.link/gwtnnxI\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"link\",\"attrs\":{\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\",\"href\":\"https://framer.link/gwtnnxI\",\"target\":\"_blank\"}}]}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\"},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"One line of copy, only when you hover.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Norell's services section doesn't explain everything upfront. It shows four names in bold, dim. You hover one, it lights up, the description appears next to it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The rest stays quiet on purpose.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Nothing competes for attention until you ask for it.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"That's not simplicity. That's control.\"}]}]},\"author\":{\"framerUserId\":\"1364828a-b355-487e-b32f-02641033b191\",\"name\":\"Tanjim Islam\",\"slug\":\"tanjim-islam\",\"avatar\":\"https://y4pdgnepgswqffpt.public.blob.vercel-storage.com/creators/28885/avatar-ctk9oa9jzfLVvcTdTNu7W0AGiFbWhc.jpg\",\"badges\":[\"available\",\"studio\"],\"followed\":false,\"followsYou\":false},\"media\":[{\"type\":\"video\",\"url\":\"https://stream.mux.com/9quJetxWwU3nEKwQfk2w022GeIHIJ3kWlHmLm8kYT8n8.m3u8\",\"metadata\":{\"posterUrl\":\"https://image.mux.com/9quJetxWwU3nEKwQfk2w022GeIHIJ3kWlHmLm8kYT8n8/thumbnail.webp?time=7.35\",\"aspectRatio\":\"4:3\",\"duration\":10.954667}}],\"resources\":[],\"contests\":[],\"categories\":[{\"id\":\"cf35162f-8406-49a9-a023-4c58024795ee\",\"name\":\"General\",\"slug\":\"general\",\"description\":\"General\",\"metaTitle\":\"General\",\"metaDescription\":\"General\"}],\"tags\":[],\"likes\":{\"count\":37,\"liked\":false},\"comments\":{\"count\":31},\"reposts\":{\"count\":15,\"reposted\":false,\"repostId\":null},\"version\":1,\"edited\":false,\"editedAt\":null,\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-24T05:27:39.119Z\",\"updatedAt\":\"2026-08-24T05:27:39.119Z\"}},{\"entityType\":\"template\",\"entityId\":\"72033\",\"entity\":{\"id\":\"72033\",\"resolved\":true,\"title\":\"Medispa\",\"body\":\"$58\",\"bodyJson\":{\"type\":\"doc\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Looking to create a professional website for your medical clinic or wellness practice? \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Medispa – Premium Medical \u0026 Wellness Framer Template\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" is designed for medspas, healthcare professionals, doctors, dermatology clinics, and wellness centers seeking a trustworthy online presence.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"With its clean, calming, and sophisticated design, Medispa helps you present your treatments, services, team, facilities, and expertise in a polished way. Every section is thoughtfully structured to create a comfortable experience for visitors while guiding them toward booking an appointment or contacting your clinic.\"}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Who Is It For?\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"bulletList\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Medspas and wellness clinics\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Doctors and healthcare professionals\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Dermatology and aesthetic clinics\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Holistic health and wellness centers\"}]}]},{\"type\":\"listItem\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Freelance designers and agencies\"}]}]}]},{\"type\":\"customHeading\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Key Features\"}],\"attrs\":{\"level\":2}},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Calming Medical Design\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Create a welcoming atmosphere with elegant layouts, refined typography, and spacious sections.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Treatment \u0026 Service Showcase\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Present your treatments, technologies, products, and wellness solutions clearly.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Professional Team Sections\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Introduce your specialists and healthcare professionals to build credibility and trust.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Fully Responsive\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Provide a seamless experience across desktop, tablet, and mobile devices.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Easy Framer Customization\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Update colors, fonts, images, content, and components without coding.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Trust-Focused Experience\",\"marks\":[{\"type\":\"bold\"}]},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" Build confidence with testimonials, informative content, contact sections, and professional layouts.\"}]},{\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"With Medispa